 so backpack (for satchel or backpack), two sacks and a pocket mirror are stored. The custom 35-55 M.D.C. bone-and-hide armor and the grooming brush have no catalog rows and are a restriction line. Money as per O.C.C. || NOT STORED: size, weight, life span, clan sizes, migration, habitat, slave value, allies and enemies are in GM Notes."
